tune (copy): clock_margin on hello, mlp24, tiny, softmax, 30 random inputs per net plus extremes, 1 games at once. A full scan takes hours; every constant prints an estimate.
clock_margin: default 512, lowest 0
  clock_margin   256 ( 16.00 tics): pass  hello 0/49  mlp24 0/49  tiny 0/33  softmax 0/33  [3 min]
  clock_margin: up to 14 more values at about 2.5 min each (estimate at the first value; maps that repeat cost nothing)
  clock_margin   192 ( 12.00 tics): pass  hello 0/49  mlp24 0/49  tiny 0/33  softmax 0/33  [5 min]
  clock_margin   128 (  8.00 tics): FAIL  hello 0/49  mlp24 49/49  tiny 0/33  softmax 0/33  [7 min]
  clock_margin   160 ( 10.00 tics): pass  hello 0/49  mlp24 0/49  tiny 0/33  softmax 0/33  [9 min]
  clock_margin   144 (  9.00 tics): FAIL  hello 0/49  mlp24 48/49  tiny 0/33  softmax 0/33  [11 min]
